        <div class="hero-rmc__pill">
          <span class="pill-dot"></span>
          <span class="pill-text">THE ADDRESS &middot; ENTERPRISE HUBS</span>
          <span class="pill-badge">GST &amp; MCA Verified</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="hero-rmc__title">
          Your Business Deserves<br>
          <span class="highlight-gold">a Better Address.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-rmc__desc">
          Virtual offices, coworking spaces, meeting rooms and business registration infrastructure across India's prime commercial locations.
        </p>

            <div class="hero-white__ctas">
              <a href="#solutionFinder" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">
                <i class="ph-bold ph-magnifying-glass"></i> Find Your Workspace
              </a>
