      <!-- FAQs -->
      <div class="faq-section reveal">
        <div class="faq-item open">
          <button class="faq-item__question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span>Is a Virtual Office 100% legal for GST and Company Registration?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__arrow">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p>Yes, absolutely. Under the CGST Act 2017 and MCA SPICe+ regulations, any enterprise can operate legally from a commercial premises provided they possess: (1) A registered commercial rent agreement, (2) An NOC from the legal property owner, and (3) A recent electricity bill. V-DESK provides 100% genuine and verified documents.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-item__question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span>What documents are required to activate a V-DESK Virtual Office?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__arrow">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p>Basic KYC documents: PAN Card, Aadhaar Card, passport photo and Certificate of Incorporation (if already incorporated). Once uploaded, your notarized agreement and NOC are issued within 24 working hours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-item__question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span>What happens during a GST physical premises inspection?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__arrow">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p>Our center managers facilitate GST inspections. Your company name is displayed on the physical directory board, legal files are maintained on site, and our concierge coordinates with the visiting officer for smooth approval.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-item__question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span>How does V-DESK handle incoming mail and couriers?</span>
            <span class="faq-item__arrow">&#9660;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__answer">
            <p>All incoming mail is logged on arrival. You receive instant WhatsApp and email notifications. On your instruction, we can scan and email contents or forward the physical courier to your address.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
